=2 Walkthrough
* You are tasked with creating an {i:Enfeeblement Kit of Silence|Enfeeb. Kit: Silence|2782}, {i:Enfeeblement Kit of Sleep|Enfeeb. Kit: Sleep|2781}, {i:Enfeeblement Kit of Poison|Enfeeb. Kit: Poison|2779}, or {i:Enfeeblement Kit of Blindness|Enfeeb. Kit: Blind|2780}.
** If you do not recall which item you have been tasked with creating, speak with one of the NPCs listed below. They will give you the recipes for making the components, but you do not have to talk to them at any point in the gathering of ingredients or the synthing of items.
*** {n:Kuroido-Moido} at (E-7) in {z:Port Windurst}.
*** {n:Faulpie} at (E-8) in {z:Southern San d'Oria}.
*** {n:Abd-al-Raziq} at (L-7) in {z:Bastok Mines}.
* For the kit, you will need:
** {i:Padded Box|Padded Box|2775}: {i:Earth Crystal|Earth Crystal|4099}, {i:Bast Parchment|Bast Parchment|1134} x2, {i:Inferior Cocoon|Inferior Cocoon|2778} (Can also be made from a {i:Woodworking Kit 5|Woodworking Kit 5|8805} from guild NPC)
** {i:Fine Parchment|Fine Parchment|2773}: {i:Dark Crystal|Dark Crystal|4103}, {i:Parchment|Parchment|917}, {i:Pumice Stone|Pumice Stone|2776} (You will need to make two of these)
** {i:Enchanted Ink|Enchanted Ink|2774}: {i:Dark Crystal|Dark Crystal|4103}, {i:Black Ink|Black Ink|929}, {i:Magicked Blood|Magicked Blood|2777} (You will need to make two of these\}
** A {i:Silencing Potion|Silencing Potion|4162}, {i:Sleeping Potion|Sleeping Potion|4161}, {p:Poison Potion}, or {i:Blinding Potion|Blinding Potion|4163} (It will depend on which enfeeblement kit you are told to make)
* Once you have obtained all the components, combine them together with an {i:Earth Crystal|Earth Crystal|4099}.
** As a note, all of the components can be traded, but the enfeeblement kit itself cannot, and therefore must be synthed by the player doing the mission.
** Synths can fail, so it may be wise to have access to extra ingredients.
** An {p:Alchemy} level of 10 is recommended to synth the Enfeeblement Kit to increase the chances of success.
* Trade the kit to the **{p:Trodden Snow}** at (H-7) in {z:Qufim Island} for a cutscene.

=3 Crafting Guide
* The {p:Enfeeblement Kit|Category:Enfeeblement Kit} page has a more detailed walkthrough how to craft the item starting from 0 skill.

=2 "A Shantotto Ascension" Key
* After completing the mission, the activity is repeatable for an additional reward once per day.
** Augmented equipment is a common reward but there is also crafting ingredients and spell scrolls.
* Head to {z:Port Jeuno} and ask {n:Squintrox Dryeyes} (G-8) for a {@k} {k:Moogle key}.
* Trade Squintrox Dryeyes the Enfeeblement Kit item he requests to receive the {@k} {k:Moogle key}.
* Go to {z:Lower Jeuno} and enter the **{p:Tenshodo} HQ**.
** If you do not have a {@k} {k:Tenshodo Member's Card}, you will need to complete the {q:Tenshodo Membership|Tenshodo Membership|Tenshodo Membership} quest.
* Interact with the red treasure coffer at (J-8) and use the {@k} {k:Moogle key} (Level 30) option to receive the reward.
** Rewards are listed on the {p:Add-on Scenario Rewards} page.

